        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Splash, Christopher Robin, Mermaid Got Married\n- People: Ron Howard, Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel, Tom Hanks, Daryl Hannah, John Candy, Eugene Levy, Marc Forster, Tom McCarthy, Alex Ross Perry, Allison Schroeder\n- Concepts: mermaids, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Splash is a 1984 American fantasy romantic comedy film directed by Ron Howard and written by Lowell Ganz and Babaloo Mandel.\n- Splash stars Tom Hanks, Daryl Hannah, John Candy, and Eugene Levy.\n- Mermaid Got Married is based on the 1984 American film Splash.\n- Mermaid Got Married has a plot about a mermaid who comes onto land and falls in love with a human man.\n- Christopher Robin is an upcoming American comedy-drama adventure film directed by Marc Forster.\n- The screenplay for Christopher Robin was written by Tom McCarthy, Alex Ross Perry, and Allison Schroeder.",
